No monster can eat every type of ring.  There are several types which
can't be eaten by anything (whether these rings are polymorph control
or hunger or whatever varies from game to game).

From the list, the following rings can't be eaten by anything
(the rest can either be eaten by a Xorn or a gelatinous cube):

>granite     mineral
>black onyx  mineral
>moonstone   mineral
>tiger eye   gemstone
>jade        gemstone
>agate       gemstone
>topaz       gemstone
>sapphire    gemstone
>ruby        gemstone
>diamond     gemstone
>emerald     gemstone


